Local AI Task Manager v{{VERSION}}
Task Manager for Local AI on Windows

QUICK START:
1. Run LocalAITaskManager.exe.
2. No installation, accounts, or administrator privileges required.
3. Requires an NVIDIA GPU with standard drivers installed.
4. Automatically detects supported local AI runtimes (Ollama, llama.cpp) when active.

WINDOWS SMARTSCREEN NOTE:
Windows SmartScreen may display an informational alert because this unsigned,
open-source binary is newly published. You can verify the SHA256 checksum and
inspect or build the source code locally from:
https://github.com/AlejandroDeBlas/local-ai-task-manager

SECURITY & PRIVACY:
- 100% offline local monitoring.
- Zero analytics, zero telemetry, zero cloud backends.
- Only network access is loopback querying of local Ollama API (http://127.0.0.1:11434/api/ps).

